  1->>28: User-decrypts a historical handle from a Store that F3a or F3b closed
  28->>49: Posts the user decryption<br />[HTTPS]
  49->>51: Forwards to every connector<br />[HTTPS]
  51->>52: Queues the request
  52->>3: Store is absent: getSignaturesForAddress(store), then the finalized closing transaction (archival RPC)<br />[JSON-RPC]
  52->>41: Fetches the allow leaf's MMR proof<br />[HTTP, CBOR]
  52->>53: Permit scope and any delegation checked against StoreClosed program and scope, proof verified against its peaks: decrypts for the user